OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA bright
OL,6,Fevening with variable amounts of cloud
OL,7,Fand few hazy sunny spells. The rest of
OL,8,Fthe night will then be dry with clear
OL,9,Fspells at first but cloudier later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FDry with a little sunshine at
OL,12,Ffirst in the north. Otherwise, a
OL,13,Fcloudy day with outbreaks of rain
OL,14,Fspreading north, turning heavier at
OL,15,Ftimes in the evening.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,18,FUnsettled on Tuesday and Wednesday
OL,19,Fwith showers or longer spells of rain,
OL,20,Foften heavy at times. Brighter on
OL,21,FThursday with a few scattered showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
